## . [cargo-workspace] Rust tools=cargo
lint                     Quality        declared exact  safe        .          cargo lint :: Lint Rust source with Clippy for the whole workspace
xt                       Testing        declared exact  safe        .          cargo xt :: Run Rust tests for the whole workspace
build                    Build          inferred high   safe        .          cargo build --workspace :: Build the workspace
test                     Testing        inferred high   safe        .          cargo test --workspace :: Run Rust tests for the whole workspace
check                    Quality        inferred high   safe        .          cargo check --workspace :: Type-check the Rust project for the whole workspace
clippy                   Quality        inferred medium safe        .          cargo clippy --workspace :: Lint Rust source with Clippy for the whole workspace
fmt                      Quality        inferred medium safe        .          cargo fmt --workspace :: Format Rust source
bench                    Testing        inferred low    safe        .          cargo bench --workspace :: Run Rust benchmarks
doc                      Build          inferred low    safe        .          cargo doc --no-deps --workspace :: Build the Rust docs
